l44.3-25.4c4.7-2.7 7.6-7.7 7.6-13.1c0-8.4-6.8-15.1-15.1-15.1H222.6c-3.4 0-6.4 2.1-7.5 5.3l-.4 1.2c-4.4 12.5-18.2 19-30.6 14.6s-19-18.2-14.6-30.6l.4-1.2zM224 352a32 32 0 1 1 64 0 32 32 0 1 1 -64 0z"/></svg> Compare</a></div>
<p>Airbyte Cloud runs and syncs your data using a specific set of IP addresses. Allow these IPs in your firewall to ensure Airbyte users can correctly use the platform.</p>
<p>Airbyte defaults to running syncs in the United States. To change this, or to check your data residency, see your <a class="" href=/platform/cloud/managing-airbyte-cloud/manage-data-residency>data residency</a> for each workspace.</p>
